            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144779,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que os atributos fazem?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eles adicionam informações adicionais às tags</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Atributos criam loops de jogo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eles geram inimigos</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Atributos criam níveis</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eles adicionam informações adicionais às tags.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como o link aparece no navegador?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Video game</code> como um link com ênfase</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> como um link normal</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> com ênfase, mas com um link quebrado</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;em&gt;Video game&lt;/em&gt;</code> como um link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Video game</code> como um link com ênfase.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144781,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/game-controls&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Controls\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O nome do atributo deve ser <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há texto entre <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Está faltando a tag de abertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O nome do atributo deve ser <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144782,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o código para que funcione corretamente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/level-1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Click to start Level 1!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"65\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144783,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione o atributo correto à tag de abertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to the Arcade!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/high-scores&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Take a look at the high\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   scores here! \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144784,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este elemento <code>img</code>?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/sprites/player.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A tag deve ter <code>img</code> como o nome da tag, não a tag <code>a</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O elemento <code>img</code> está faltando uma tag de fechamento</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Está faltando uma URL para acessar a imagem</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A tag deve ter <code>img</code> como o nome da tag, não a tag <code>a</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Defina o atributo <code>width</code> nesta tag de imagem para <code>\"300\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/player-sprite.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"300\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
